  "description": "Torque has been tested for two years now, and has evolved in to this ‘Motard’ style of city bike. The CroMo frame with cast dropouts is a modern mountain bike frame, designed for large tires and a rigid fork. The Torque has 650b wheels and large 2.8\" tires for all around-‘ness’, wide 760mm Mountain Bike style handle bars for control and aggressive stance to match the tires, Shimano hydraulic brakes, and a 1x10 Speed Drivetrain make this one of the most unique bikes on the market. Torque could be a city shopping bike, an urban commuter, a hooligan city sprinter, or a trail bike out of the box.",
